                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The official wand carried by a herald in ancient Greece and Rome, specifically the one carried in mythology by Hermes, the messenger of the gods, usually represented with two snakes twined around it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
